<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px; color:#172033; font-size:26px; line-height:34px;">Final reminder before account deletion</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Your Free Quantified Self account is still inactive. We previously emailed you a 30-day deletion warning.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;"><strong>Sign in before {{deletion_deadline}} to keep your account.</strong> Your account and its associated activities, health data, settings, connections, and uploaded files may be permanently deleted on or after this deadline.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;"><a href="{{login_url}}" style="color:#174ea6; font-weight:700;">Sign in to keep my account</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Signing in cancels the inactivity deletion. You do not need to buy a subscription. This reminder does not extend the original 30-day warning period. Automatic provider sync and requests from connected MCP clients do not reset the inactivity clock.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Basic and Pro memberships, including trials and gifted access, are protected while their access or subscription grace period remains active.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If you want to keep a separate copy of your data, sign in and export it before the deadline. Account deletion cannot be undone in the app. If you need help, contact <a href="mailto:{{support_email}}" style="color:#174ea6;">{{support_email}}</a>.</p>
